# 2) Explain monolithic architecture vs. microservices architecture.

1. Understand the basic difference

Monolithic architecture: The application is built and deployed as one unit, usually containing multiple business modules.

Microservices architecture: The application is divided into multiple independently deployable services, each responsible for a specific business capability.

